# Tauri dev-mode file watcher exclusions (gitignore syntax).
#
# binaries/ is the vendored Python runtime (scripts/vendor-python.ps1,
# docs/tasks/python-runtime-bundling.md) - hundreds of files, and its own
# __pycache__ churns every time a script actually runs. Without this, the
# dev watcher treats that churn as a source change and rebuild-restarts the
# whole app in a loop - observed for real, not hypothetical.
binaries/
